WEBVTT

00:07.120 --> 00:12.280
The 26th year of Longwu shocking news came from the north.

00:13.120 --> 00:18.560
Shilang led a great army south to attack Xuan Kingdom claiming to have 180,000 troops.

00:19.040 --> 00:22.680
Enough to drink the rivers dry their whips could block the flow.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.280
Now Wei Kingdom marches south claiming 180,000 armored soldiers.

00:32.720 --> 00:38.600
Brave generals like a forest we truly cannot contend with them Your servant believes.

00:38.680 --> 00:42.360
To shift the strategic focus from Beiyu Pass to Tianhe.

00:42.440 --> 00:48.200
Then we can use the navy to defend would be the best strategy yes, yes.

00:48.280 --> 00:49.880
Chancellor Xie is indeed thoughtful.

00:50.720 --> 00:54.240
Your Majesty Your servant wishes to impeach Xie Jian'an.

00:57.280 --> 01:01.000
With a great enemy at hand showing cowardice before battle what is his intention?

01:02.920 --> 01:08.800
Your Majesty to just give Beiyu Pass to others Your servant absolutely cannot accept.

01:09.080 --> 01:14.480
Exactly we absolutely cannot accept censor Wang this is truly treasonous.

01:14.720 --> 01:19.880
I ask you holding Beiyu Pass, the battle line is too long for a large army to fight.

01:19.960 --> 01:23.080
How should supplies be provided?

01:23.240 --> 01:28.600
Use the Qing Province canal the late emperor spent his life building that canal.

01:28.680 --> 01:31.240
How can it not be used now?

01:31.320 --> 01:37.080
Censor Wang is right foolhardy courage this is reckless behavior.

01:37.440 --> 01:41.640
Will lead to disaster Chancellor Xie is right what should we do?

01:41.720 --> 01:46.160
I think you're the one who's senile how do you know without trying?

01:46.240 --> 01:47.640
Truly forgetting one's ancestors.

